Here is a list of network communication technologies and methods that can operate without a traditional Wi-Fi Access Point (AP).

### 1\. Wireless communication

| Technology                 | How it communicates                     |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| Bluetooth Classic          | Direct device-to-device                 |
| Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) | Direct low-power wireless communication |
| Wi-Fi Direct               | Direct Wi-Fi connection                 |
| Wi-Fi Ad hoc (IBSS)        | Device-to-device wireless network       |
| Wi-Fi Aware (NAN)          | Discovers and connects nearby devices   |
| Wi-Fi Mesh                 | Devices relay data between nodes        |
| Wi-Fi Neighbor Awareness   | Peer discovery and communication        |
| NFC                        | Very short-range communication          |
| Infrared (IR)              | Direct optical communication            |
| Zigbee                     | Device-to-device or mesh communication  |
| Thread                     | IPv6-based mesh networking              |
| Z-Wave                     | Wireless mesh networking                |
| LoRa                       | Long-range radio communication          |
| LoRaWAN                    | Long-range star-based radio networking  |
| UWB                        | Short-range wireless communication      |
| Wireless USB               | Direct wireless device communication    |

